{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "65d0898837e5c4cbd962cda7b65cb9923f5bee166d0eff1b51babcd06da70736", "ja": "アンコール", "zh": "安可", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "be1586a282f96b288e9cd9b5c2f38c82bbc5376b75e2a9fcc7d8d6092529e8f5", "ja": "大歓声に見送られ、舞台袖に戻ってきた\n『Clover』の4人はステージの感想で盛り\n上がる。志保が早速反省会をしようと提案\nしたところでアンコールの声が響き、\n4人は笑顔で再びステージへ向かう。", "zh": "在热烈的欢呼声中退场，回到侧台的\n“Clover”4人热烈地讨论着舞台的感想。\n就在志保提议立刻召开反省会时，\n安可声响彻全场，4人面带笑容再次走向舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1000_audience", "source_sha256": "6dfa510daae0fa6f91a59dd5193148c16b09ebeac6055024e66f25eecc32f2f6", "ja": "ワアアアァァァッ！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "f640412d316b42e55197e00f2d9bd5ed0bba63bc9c294f75a4325174c7d3909c", "ja": "プロデューサー、ただいまー！\nもー、すっごく楽しかったよー！", "zh": "制作人，我回来啦——！\n真是特别开心啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "55be74e4b9c32de9731b59ff82a6368d549af2f28b116bf6d8d9f5b4beeffd64", "ja": "会場のみなさんも、\nとっても大きな声で応援してくれてました！", "zh": "会场的各位也用非常响亮的声音为我们加油了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "53b499c276ce6db7061724f237f73b3da18b24ef1474716daeca01ec8ff9a26d", "ja": "横断幕を持ってたのって、可奈の学校の子達よね？\nさっき言ってた、合唱部の……。", "zh": "拿着横幅的，是可奈学校的同学们吧？\n就是刚才提到的合唱部……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "2bc00d3ef30be4e6c4236b69483096acc9a03c2d47940665e822ad549c5fdf7e", "ja": "うん♪　みんな、すっごい楽しんでくれてた！\nプロデューサーさんはどうでしたか？", "zh": "嗯♪　大家都看得超级开心！\n制作人先生觉得怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1005_405bcp", "source_sha256": "52675341dd1d370ef654f88bfe1d430ac06a6de24976b6875fc3bfe3c1a8902f", "ja": "オレも最高のステージだったと思うぞ。他のみんなも、\nきっと同じように思ったんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我也觉得这是最棒的舞台。其他人也一定有同样的感受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "d30047f82c4dca1c963a7850d467dd0c1c4a2d372572b000407d65be4b7fc96d", "ja": "ありがとうございます。でも……。\n『最高』は、まだ早いです。", "zh": "谢谢。不过……现在说“最棒”，还为时过早。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "eb92ccc6a380b0ea05893347daf7aa1ee16e929a6e2ca88d6dfe79a16ee441b3", "ja": "私達はこれから、\nもっと成長しないといけませんから。", "zh": "因为从现在开始，我们还必须继续成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "9b726236a147a25c855e7dc3745b15fa48a2d5a752e8b6ae731458de1c297f06", "ja": "！　そうだよね♪　ずっとみんなで\nステージに立てるように、頑張らなきゃだもんね！", "zh": "！是啊♪ 为了以后能一直和大家站在舞台上，我们得努力才行嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "ad6312ac7b404cbe711e71c310ddda48f120309119d7709104ec94203cb8e429", "ja": "Cloverは～♪　4人でひとつ～♪", "zh": "Clover是～♪　4个人合为一体～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "5b0c53bc618bde587d6ee532344c186540bcff5003e7d4d7e3f1a29446d79d96", "ja": "はい！　わたしもみなさんと一緒に、\nもっともっと、たくさんの景色を見てみたいです♪", "zh": "是的！我也想和大家一起，去看更多更多的风景♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1011_405bcp", "source_sha256": "29a7d1c4d7d8537519c5a75878220f69075b5690a2e30327151817ebd4d85995", "ja": "なるほど。それじゃ……。\n今日はまあまあだったよ。", "zh": "原来如此。那就……今天还算不错吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "70bc709713b29a96ff615b46ab015b19a85f5e34cba1a6d1088212cf4e892c78", "ja": "はい。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "好的。非常感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "d81f99237940461cfb6b1b5b0bca7db4b6189c91dd98c38f869c716f5f68f464", "ja": "それじゃ、着替えたら早速反省会をしましょう。\nプロデューサーさん、レッスンルーム借りられますか？", "zh": "那么，换好衣服后就马上开反思会吧。\n制作人，能借到练习室吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "ab377171853e5a16d358cd0ba99f06c4eee0dd3cd7f482e68fc0e640445fc448", "ja": "ええっ、ちょっと待って志保ちゃん！\nライブ成功の打ち上げは～！？", "zh": "诶诶，等一下，志保！演唱会成功后的庆功宴呢～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "d5c1014779272b533b77a2521d75c83dda3a5ed7cba651ebb090a3bbf5d39334", "ja": "そんな暇あるわけないでしょ。もっと成長するために、\nすぐ反省点を修正しないと。", "zh": "怎么可能有那种闲工夫。为了进一步成长，必须马上改正需要反省的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "ff3bf6a0a56603c903fcc755ff25198d2b586e544a20d78d638b410863cccbaf", "ja": "スパルタ志保ちゃんだ……！", "zh": "这是斯巴达式的志保……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "2fb656e69b7af99b1f89aa2bda5014c566f770845f4a2b1831720b17c5622218", "ja": "スパルタ志保さんです……！", "zh": "这是斯巴达式的志保小姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "f36d220f0cb21366218f44b64c30a4a0215208a29262052e2b66fc9baf20929c", "ja": "スパルタしほりんだ……！", "zh": "是斯巴达志保琳……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1019_405bcp", "source_sha256": "43614c319588aa71f371c70351569dbf8974a7f9edd8fabc29fd404bfa37d8b3", "ja": "はは、やる気があることはいい事だけど……。\nでもその前に、やることが残ってるぞ。", "zh": "哈哈，有干劲是好事，不过……\n但在那之前，还有事情要做哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "6e44072fb32d636146f01f0cce67c7ce15c45caf5c65be6fa8e77b909a45ae5a", "ja": "えっ？　あっ……！", "zh": "诶？啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1021_audience", "source_sha256": "46916ff0e56e721daaae35b1569628199b7c21845657497927aabb8ad85d3a7b", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "4215fa7148aa504d8b1acb65f78a307404fa695194d66d26ee1ff512acd62cc2", "ja": "みんなが……。", "zh": "大家……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "69d9921dd71f6f7d6adc2b8baf1db8118b71f8bb72d9eeb4b5407cd8e06f95d3", "ja": "呼んでくれてる！\nしほりん、かなりん、せりりん♪", "zh": "在喊我呢！\n志保凛、可奈凛、星梨凛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "55a59ef9be98aae58bab907d3839f6089bf0bfc04fde97bfffe6cb61211fd3e1", "ja": "はい♪　それじゃあ、プロデューサーさん！", "zh": "好♪那么，制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "7fa28ad9c21bf381adbac9baf0309993a9105c1d4c82ed581112102da7ff3626", "ja": "行ってきま～す♪", "zh": "我出发啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "2a411e9294ba0855cbd5edcfd7a87c25c4d8fe9d708426b89facec2e6dc5e322", "ja": "私は高坂海美！！\n一緒にアイドル楽しもうね♪", "zh": "我是高坂海美！！\n一起享受偶像活动吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "08c17cde860d379d4233faa3322fd61e4b45c810b9ac6e44e6fb98752c2d1633", "ja": "私の応援、志保ちゃんに届いてたんだね。\nよかった……♪", "zh": "我的加油，传达给志保了呢。\n太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "671ac020e906322f0137b99adeacdf3f8dc863d9809b1eb602583d141de57784", "ja": "わたしがここにいれば、もし志保さんが夜に\n劇場に来たら、あったかい紅茶をいれてあげられます。", "zh": "只要我待在这里，要是志保小姐晚上来到剧场，我就能为她泡一杯热红茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "a6166902eff830ffa1ce852653d1edba12017f88daee06e622a6f0bbe8ecf6ac", "ja": "それでも私は、この4人でステージに立ちたいです。", "zh": "即便如此，我还是想和这4个人一起站上舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_07_1031_405bcp", "source_sha256": "59a861baf2d8c480a5249ef94c8fabc514256fabd127caa1b3e70a69d0b8bf8e", "ja": "本当に色々あったけど、いいチームになったな。\nこれからの成長も、期待してるぞ。", "zh": "虽然真的发生了各种各样的事，但我们已经成为一支很棒的队伍了。\n我也期待着你们今后的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
